data: {"id": "69d56f761f2d4a9b-thinking-layer-432", "run_id": "69d56f761f2d4a9b", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_token", "tool_name": null, "content": "\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788459305744}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "69d56f761f2d4a9b-thinking-layer-433", "run_id": "69d56f761f2d4a9b", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "工具返回的信息有限，但我观察到 Pod 状态为 `Running` 且 `READY` 为 `0/1`。根据常见的 Kubernetes 异常模式，这通常对应两种情况：\n1. **Pod NotReady Probe Failed**: 容器运行但健康检查失败。\n2. **Pod Config Error**: 容器创建配置错误（有时表现为 `CreateContainerConfigError`，但也可能处于 `Running` 但启动失败的状态，取决于具体实现和探针配置）。\n\n考虑到 `READY 0/1` 且 `STATUS Running`，最直接的归类是 `NotReadyProbeFailed`。如果是因为配置缺失导致容器无法启动，通常状态会是 `CrashLoopBackOff` 或 `CreateContainerConfigError`。这里容器是 `Running` 的，说明容器进程已启动，只是没有通过就绪检查。\n\n为了验证并获取更精确的诊断步骤，我将获取 `pod-notready-probe-failed.md` 运行手册。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788459306268}

